{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060970/block/singleImage/3252307/df/01M63AFBTPM701735AT417872Y.jpg?updatedAt=1793260519\"/><figcaption>大圍UNI Residence一房1.7萬租出 業主享4.4厘回報｜入伙盤租賃</figcaption></figure><p>中原地產大圍豪宅圍方柏傲莊分行資深區域營業董事龐耀昌表示，近期整體市況暢旺，大圍新晉屋苑 UNI Residence 暫錄 2 宗租賃成交，最新錄得中層 E 室，單位實用面積約 292 方呎，一房間隔，議價後以 1.7 萬元租出，呎租約 58.2 元。 據了解，新租客為同區客，見屋苑樓齡新，單位價錢合理，間隔合用，即承租單位自用。業主於 2025 年 5 月以約 462 萬元購入單位，現享約 4.4 厘租金回報。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060970/block/singleImage/3252323/wm/01M63A2TJ8JSZ2D5AS195S44HE.jpeg?updatedAt=1793260519\"/><figcaption>UNI Residence暫錄2宗租賃成交。(地產組攝)</figcaption></figure><p>現有 38 個放租盤 最平叫價 1.6 萬 龐耀昌指，屋苑現時有租盤放盤約 38 個，叫租約 1.6 萬至 2.8 萬元。資料顯示， UNI Residence 位於沙田大圍顯和里 7 號，屬單幢式住宅，提供 240 個住宅單位。 即睇大圍 UNI Residence 租盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:42:17.181285+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":426,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T19:18:09.463103+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:38:21.540455+00:00","content_hash":"1c301147104291fe9618689796cf78ee1319623db3747858de3cf458a799fd6f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:42:17.181285+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}